  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vanuatu Cyclone Pam recovery project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the project will provide vulnerable families with shelter materials and training in appropriate storm resistant building techniques to 60 (300 people) families.  It will provide disaster preparedness training to 450 students and teachers in Port Vila and it will pre-position temporary shelter kits (tarpaulins an, ropes, etc.) and hygiene kits (Buckets with lids, jerry cans, soap, sanitary towels, etc.) for 1000 families (5000 people)</narrative>
  </description>
